course: dictionary
lesson: 3206
title: Making things better: enhance
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Enhance is a verb, so it is a doing word. It means to make something better, stronger or more attractive. Its forms are enhance, enhances, enhanced and enhancing.
explain: Look for clues in the sentence. «The sunshine enhanced the colours of the garden.» The sunshine makes the flowers look brighter and nicer, so enhanced means made better.
explain: Enhance can also mean making a picture or sound clearer. «Enhance the photo» means make the picture sharper so you can see more detail. To check your meaning, swap in "make better" and see if the sentence still makes sense.
fact: Enhance means to make something better, stronger or more attractive, or to improve its quality or value.
fact: In computing, «enhance» means to make a picture or sound clearer.
fact: Spices can «enhance the flavour» of food, so a pinch of cinnamon can make a cake taste even better.
fact: Useful phrases are «enhance quality» and «enhanced by», as in a story enhanced by brilliant pictures.
exercise: «Spices can enhance the flavour of a meal.» What does enhance mean here? | *Make it taste better | Cook it for much longer | Make it smell of smoke | Remove all the salt
exercise: «The editor helped enhance her story with bright, detailed words.» What does enhance mean? | Delete it | Read it aloud | *Make it better | Put it in a box
exercise: A detective asks an expert to enhance a blurry photo. What is she asking for? | Throw it away | Print it in black and white | Make the photo smaller | *Make the photo clearer
test: Which word is the past tense of enhance? | enhances | enhancing | *enhanced
test: «Her kind words enhanced the party.» What does enhanced mean? | *Made the party better | Forgot about the party | Ended the party
exam: Which sentence uses enhance to mean make a picture clearer? | The bell will enhance at nine o'clock | *The expert used software to enhance the blurry photo | Mum will enhance the soup with extra pepper | The children enhanced their bedroom with a nap
